  "description": "Implements one GitHub issue end to end: plan (Opus) → codegen → implement (Hydrogen, ponytail) → quality gate → review (Sonnet, code-review + ponytail-review) → PR → wait for CI, with an investigate/fix loop on CI failure. Run input: \"Implement issue #<n>. Base branch: <branch>.\" (the Spec Implementation fan-out sends this per ticket, with base spec/<n>). Never merges: the PR is left for the parent workflow or a human. Start it in a new worktree.",
